  "prefLabel": "Fam 404.07 Family Dynamics",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 404.07 Family Dynamics. Courses on Family Dynamics shall cover one or more of the following topics:\n\n(a) Child development;\n\n(b) Impact of divorce and separation on families;\n\n(c) Substance misuse;\n\n(d) Mental health issues; and\n\n(e) Family relationships.\n\nSource. #12988, eff 2-6-20",
